{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^“Halo, selamat pagi, perkenalkan saya …, kalian asalnya dari mana?” ","#","^speaker:Tour Guide ","/#","#","^portrait:tourguide_wide_smile ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","^“Dari sini kok, pak”","#","^speaker:Gita ","/#","#","^portrait:gita_default ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Yang rambut merah dari Bogor tuh, pak”","#","^speaker:Baskara ","/#","#","^portrait:baskara_mean ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Asbun banget, aku tinggal di Tangerang, juga. Tapi lahir disini kok, Pak.”","#","^speaker:Yuda ","/#","#","^portrait:yuda_angry ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Oh begitu… kalian sudah pernah kesini sebelumnya?”","#","^speaker:Tour Guide ","/#","#","^portrait:tourguide_awkward ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","^Gita, Baskara, Yuda : “Belum pak”","\n","^“Eh- kayanya pernah pak, dulu waktu kecil.”","#","^speaker:Baskara ","/#","#","^portrait:baskara_smile ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Ohh, berarti sudah lupa ya. Kalau nanti ada yang ingin ditanyakan, tanyakan saja ya”","#","^speaker:Tour Guide ","/#","#","^portrait:tourguide_more_friendly ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n","^Gita, Baskara, Yuda :“Siap Pak”","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}